<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84332" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποίμν-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flock,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.122
			</span></i>; prop. <i>of sheep,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουκολίας ἀγέλας τε καὶ αἰπόλια
					πλατἔ αἰγῶν ποίμνας τ᾽ είροπόκων ὀΐων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					446
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τά τε αἰπόλια καὶ τὰς π. καὶ τὰ
					βουκόλια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.126
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				653
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				415e
			</span></i>, etc.: generally, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποῖμναι κάπρων λεόντων τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					238
				</span></i>
			; of a single animal, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσεόμαλλος
			π.,</span> of the ram with golden fleece, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				725
			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				52.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph. of
			persons, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				642
			</span></i>(lyr., of the Furies), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eu.</u>
				197
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποίμνη δίπους,</span> of
			mankind, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				267c
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
